    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agony 'N' Torture is a fast-paced endless arcade styled game in which you have to dodge blocks, collect coins, and grab powerups all while attempting to get the highest score possible! The game has 36 unique modifiers you can unlock that spice up the gameplay as well as 12 different powerups/hazards to provide you with an advantage/disadvantage during a run.\u00a0There are\u00a03 difficulties, a randomizer mode,\u00a0a classic mode, and\u00a039 different skins you can earn through points and completing challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WARNING: This game will make you experience Agony 'N' Torture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave feedback/suggestions in the comments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo contains Easy, Normal, and Hard difficulties, the first 3 modifiers, and the first 9 powerups/hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huge thanks to Emily Kapsalis for making 90% of the art in/for the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can check her stuff out by searching up\u00a0Snowy_Dragoon on Itch.io!</p>",
